 "content": "# Missing continuation at an edge\n\nWhen color 1 marks an absent continuation at a grid edge, compare repeated rows, bands, or motif copies to infer the expected continuation and affected cells. The continuation may be a solid suffix or only selected motif-phase positions. Color only confirmed missing cells; preserve the existing motif and unrelated cells. Choose repeated copies from the demonstrated pattern, not from rightmost zeros or suffix length alone.\n"
}

